    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/4089c2cacb63b8a6690b5019f2b92a46.avif?t=1755244632\" data-has-big width=800 height=170 /></span><strong>Trackastrophe! </strong>is a wacky puzzle game about an eccentric old train travelling a colorful world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyse the maps, make a path by placing a variety of different track tiles, then pray your train gets to the end in one piece!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/006edb259010164091c5dd95d2641cf0.avif?t=1755244632\" data-has-big width=800 height=72 /></span>The game features over<strong> 100+ levels</strong> which will make you travel through different locations, each including their own unique <strong>themes</strong> and <strong>mechanics</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/9cb77648ec3b4677ad34a781b08ac2cb.poster.avif?t=1755244632\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/9cb77648ec3b4677ad34a781b08ac2cb.webm?t=1755244632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/9cb77648ec3b4677ad34a781b08ac2cb.mp4?t=1755244632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/cc890843ef82c6160c076a0253aa9d7b.avif?t=1755244632\" data-has-big width=800 height=72 /></span>For those who seek a bigger challenge, the game features several <strong>bonus</strong> levels that will be sure to make you think!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/f42c7adad74333ce86bae00843dd788a.poster.avif?t=1755244632\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/f42c7adad74333ce86bae00843dd788a.webm?t=1755244632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/f42c7adad74333ce86bae00843dd788a.mp4?t=1755244632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/869848354a5c48a7a579064276fd5385.avif?t=1755244632\" data-has-big width=800 height=72 /></span>From <strong>tunnels</strong> to <strong>portals</strong> to very slippery <strong>ice</strong>, each world contains new mechanics for you to discover!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/2241ce8bc92eefda18bd425f8bcfa6fa.poster.avif?t=1755244632\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/2241ce8bc92eefda18bd425f8bcfa6fa.webm?t=1755244632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/2241ce8bc92eefda18bd425f8bcfa6fa.mp4?t=1755244632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/4089c2cacb63b8a6690b5019f2b92a46.avif?t=1755244632\" data-has-big width=800 height=170 /></span><strong>Trackastrophe! </strong>is a wacky puzzle game about an eccentric old train travelling a colorful world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyse the maps, make a path by placing a variety of different track tiles, then pray your train gets to the end in one piece!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/006edb259010164091c5dd95d2641cf0.avif?t=1755244632\" data-has-big width=800 height=72 /></span>The game features over<strong> 100+ levels</strong> which will make you travel through different locations, each including their own unique <strong>themes</strong> and <strong>mechanics</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/9cb77648ec3b4677ad34a781b08ac2cb.poster.avif?t=1755244632\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/9cb77648ec3b4677ad34a781b08ac2cb.webm?t=1755244632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/9cb77648ec3b4677ad34a781b08ac2cb.mp4?t=1755244632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/cc890843ef82c6160c076a0253aa9d7b.avif?t=1755244632\" data-has-big width=800 height=72 /></span>For those who seek a bigger challenge, the game features several <strong>bonus</strong> levels that will be sure to make you think!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/f42c7adad74333ce86bae00843dd788a.poster.avif?t=1755244632\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/f42c7adad74333ce86bae00843dd788a.webm?t=1755244632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/f42c7adad74333ce86bae00843dd788a.mp4?t=1755244632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/869848354a5c48a7a579064276fd5385.avif?t=1755244632\" data-has-big width=800 height=72 /></span>From <strong>tunnels</strong> to <strong>portals</strong> to very slippery <strong>ice</strong>, each world contains new mechanics for you to discover!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/2241ce8bc92eefda18bd425f8bcfa6fa.poster.avif?t=1755244632\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/2241ce8bc92eefda18bd425f8bcfa6fa.webm?t=1755244632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419850/extras/2241ce8bc92eefda18bd425f8bcfa6fa.mp4?t=1755244632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
